                        "glosses": [
                            "A unisex given name.",
                            "A male or female given name from Old Welsh Morcant, possibly from *mor (“sea”) (Welsh môr) or *mọr (“great”) (Old Welsh maur) + *kantos (“circle”) (Welsh cant), meaning “great chief” or “sea chief”."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
