                                "sense_id": "4612a86f-533f-302e-bbda-063d10f1f551",
                                "text": "Morgan Sanner, a 27-year-old human resources worker in Ohio, told New York magazine’s The Cut that she felt inspired to follow in the footsteps of other people — who she noticed were “taking significant breaks” from their careers — after going abroad for the first time."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
